# Module: diagram
Make relationships, structure, or a process easy to follow. Choose the diagram type,
direction, and level of detail for the question and available width. Keep labels readable;
split into related views if one diagram becomes crowded. Mermaid is available for
standard diagrams; custom HTML/CSS or SVG can express relationships it does not suit.
When using Mermaid, quote labels containing special characters and escape HTML in
source embedded in HTML elements.
